    "together with the saturation curves and the Scatchard plot. The Scatchard\n",
    "transformation (B/[L*] vs B) is a visual diagnostic: a straight line is\n",
    "consistent with simple 1:1 binding; pronounced curvature suggests\n",
    "multiple sites, cooperativity, or non-specific binding.\n"
